Z||000004||rockcrawl||03-20-2001||07:15 AM||||There are a couple people around here that use a special latex paint on the front of their Fieros and Porsches to protect the real paint while autocrossing. It looks like hell, but it peels right off after the race. The cool thing is that you can do clear or colors. I've seen the porsche with black and white checkered flag design covering the front end, looked pretty neat.||||reg||1
